    Description = 'Plan custom olive oil bottle labels around oily handling, dark glass, usable panels, harvest versions, gift packs and testing on real filled bottles.'
    Category = 'Olive oil packaging'
    CardDescription = 'Match olive artwork and clear product information to oily handling, dark glass, harvest changes and gift sets.'
